      "The association persisted after adjustment for the Follicular Lymphoma International Prognostic Index, with a hazard ratio of 6.44 (95 per cent confidence interval 4.33 to 9.58).",
      "An independent validation set of 147 patients gave an index-adjusted hazard ratio of 19.8.",
